{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2006, as a journalist, you broke a sensational story that made your name known across the media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, you receive a mysterious call from an anonymous person someone connected to that very event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You still see this story as headline material, and you set off toward an abandoned, horror\u00a0 house in hopes of uncovering the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there\u2019s one problem: this terrifying place is believed, according to many faiths, to be the house of the Antichrist said to appear near the end of days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/064bb4554c019045e17aec4d0b9e6014.poster.avif?t=1763207073\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/064bb4554c019045e17aec4d0b9e6014.webm?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/064bb4554c019045e17aec4d0b9e6014.mp4?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BASED ON A TRUE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to a 2006 report that surfaced in the Pakistani media, a poor widow in a village near Lahore gave birth to a baby boy with a single eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The child was named <strong>Masum</strong>, and his mother kept him hidden from the world for years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/84b57c070ca839f181b3e9e42fea7678.poster.avif?t=1763207073\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/84b57c070ca839f181b3e9e42fea7678.webm?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/84b57c070ca839f181b3e9e42fea7678.mp4?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In his youth, Masum was trained by a mysterious sorcerer and soon rose to prominence across Pakistan for his mastery of the occult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But his dark actions spread fear. Citizens, shaken by his growing power, turned to religious leaders and scholars but no one could find a way to stop him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some claimed Masum was <strong>the Antichrist</strong>, destined to disappear and return from Khorasan. Media reports amplified these rumors. Others believed he wasn\u2019t the Antichrist, but a powerful magician whose abilities could be neutralized if he was captured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unable to withstand public pressure and media outrage, the authorities eventually decided to eliminate him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/221d9cf1f4ac28f7048e3fd9b4ea98ba.poster.avif?t=1763207073\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/221d9cf1f4ac28f7048e3fd9b4ea98ba.webm?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/221d9cf1f4ac28f7048e3fd9b4ea98ba.mp4?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A team was sent to raid his house but Masum had vanished without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No body. No clues. Nothing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR MISSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly a decade ago, you were the journalist who helped expose Masoom, claiming he was the Antichrist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as the world had moved on, an anonymous woman calls you and whispers:\u00a0<strong>\u201cThey still hear terrible sounds coming from Masum\u2019s abandoned house\u2026\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to follow up on the original story now titled <strong>\u201cTen Years After the Incident\u201d</strong>\u00a0you take your camera and your courage and set out for the forgotten village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/47928bf6b03fadd8c82e18beba72208b.poster.avif?t=1763207073\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/47928bf6b03fadd8c82e18beba72208b.webm?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/47928bf6b03fadd8c82e18beba72208b.mp4?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THEME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The storyline is inspired by real events and has been adapted into a fictional narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place entirely within a large, abandoned house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/7fbd2e4c722e56f52bc07b57396693fe.poster.avif?t=1763207073\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/7fbd2e4c722e56f52bc07b57396693fe.webm?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/7fbd2e4c722e56f52bc07b57396693fe.mp4?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Horror Experience:</strong> Play from a first-person perspective and immerse yourself in fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Survival:</strong> Roam through silent, abandoned rooms, follow clues, and navigate the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Tension:</strong> The game relies on jump scares, a disturbing atmosphere, and paranormal events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Hidden Clues:</strong> Discover the secrets of the past by uncovering hidden clues throughout the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/58b031be1d297b9cf5759ab88bc26148.poster.avif?t=1763207073\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/58b031be1d297b9cf5759ab88bc26148.webm?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/58b031be1d297b9cf5759ab88bc26148.mp4?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/27943a05a205fc9119e63df9078318c4.poster.avif?t=1763207073\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/27943a05a205fc9119e63df9078318c4.webm?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/27943a05a205fc9119e63df9078318c4.mp4?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters are specially designed to match the story.<br>There will be 3 main terrifying characters in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/1407c7241090343af47b9eb805590cf4.poster.avif?t=1763207073\" width=800 height=341 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/1407c7241090343af47b9eb805590cf4.webm?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VOICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All voice lines in the trailer and in the game are professionally recorded by voice actors.<br>No artificial intelligence has been used visually or audibly anywhere in the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story inspired by a true event</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological and atmospheric horror-focused design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality sound design with disturbing effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumpscares and an immersive exploration-oriented experience</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTENT WARNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains jump scares, disturbing environments, and psychological horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not recommended for individuals with heart conditions, epilepsy, or during pregnancy.</strong><br>Please play with caution.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902550?t=1763207073","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902550?t=1763207073","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/e83211f08cad9782288ddb4ff70754381ecdcb73/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763207073","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/e83211f08cad9782288ddb4ff70754381ecdcb73/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763207073","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains disturbing themes, scenes of psychological horror, and depictions of death. There is partial non-sexual nudity presented in a horror context. Viewer discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2006, as a journalist, you broke a sensational story that made your name known across the media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, you receive a mysterious call from an anonymous person someone connected to that very event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You still see this story as headline material, and you set off toward an abandoned, horror\u00a0 house in hopes of uncovering the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there\u2019s one problem: this terrifying place is believed, according to many faiths, to be the house of the Antichrist said to appear near the end of days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/064bb4554c019045e17aec4d0b9e6014.poster.avif?t=1763207073\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/064bb4554c019045e17aec4d0b9e6014.webm?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/064bb4554c019045e17aec4d0b9e6014.mp4?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BASED ON A TRUE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to a 2006 report that surfaced in the Pakistani media, a poor widow in a village near Lahore gave birth to a baby boy with a single eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The child was named <strong>Masum</strong>, and his mother kept him hidden from the world for years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/84b57c070ca839f181b3e9e42fea7678.poster.avif?t=1763207073\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/84b57c070ca839f181b3e9e42fea7678.webm?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/84b57c070ca839f181b3e9e42fea7678.mp4?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In his youth, Masum was trained by a mysterious sorcerer and soon rose to prominence across Pakistan for his mastery of the occult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But his dark actions spread fear. Citizens, shaken by his growing power, turned to religious leaders and scholars but no one could find a way to stop him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some claimed Masum was <strong>the Antichrist</strong>, destined to disappear and return from Khorasan. Media reports amplified these rumors. Others believed he wasn\u2019t the Antichrist, but a powerful magician whose abilities could be neutralized if he was captured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unable to withstand public pressure and media outrage, the authorities eventually decided to eliminate him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/221d9cf1f4ac28f7048e3fd9b4ea98ba.poster.avif?t=1763207073\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/221d9cf1f4ac28f7048e3fd9b4ea98ba.webm?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/221d9cf1f4ac28f7048e3fd9b4ea98ba.mp4?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A team was sent to raid his house but Masum had vanished without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No body. No clues. Nothing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR MISSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly a decade ago, you were the journalist who helped expose Masoom, claiming he was the Antichrist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as the world had moved on, an anonymous woman calls you and whispers:\u00a0<strong>\u201cThey still hear terrible sounds coming from Masum\u2019s abandoned house\u2026\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to follow up on the original story now titled <strong>\u201cTen Years After the Incident\u201d</strong>\u00a0you take your camera and your courage and set out for the forgotten village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/47928bf6b03fadd8c82e18beba72208b.poster.avif?t=1763207073\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/47928bf6b03fadd8c82e18beba72208b.webm?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/47928bf6b03fadd8c82e18beba72208b.mp4?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THEME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The storyline is inspired by real events and has been adapted into a fictional narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place entirely within a large, abandoned house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/7fbd2e4c722e56f52bc07b57396693fe.poster.avif?t=1763207073\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/7fbd2e4c722e56f52bc07b57396693fe.webm?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/7fbd2e4c722e56f52bc07b57396693fe.mp4?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Horror Experience:</strong> Play from a first-person perspective and immerse yourself in fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Survival:</strong> Roam through silent, abandoned rooms, follow clues, and navigate the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Tension:</strong> The game relies on jump scares, a disturbing atmosphere, and paranormal events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Hidden Clues:</strong> Discover the secrets of the past by uncovering hidden clues throughout the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/58b031be1d297b9cf5759ab88bc26148.poster.avif?t=1763207073\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/58b031be1d297b9cf5759ab88bc26148.webm?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/58b031be1d297b9cf5759ab88bc26148.mp4?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/27943a05a205fc9119e63df9078318c4.poster.avif?t=1763207073\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/27943a05a205fc9119e63df9078318c4.webm?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/27943a05a205fc9119e63df9078318c4.mp4?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters are specially designed to match the story.<br>There will be 3 main terrifying characters in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/1407c7241090343af47b9eb805590cf4.poster.avif?t=1763207073\" width=800 height=341 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/extras/1407c7241090343af47b9eb805590cf4.webm?t=1763207073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VOICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All voice lines in the trailer and in the game are professionally recorded by voice actors.<br>No artificial intelligence has been used visually or audibly anywhere in the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story inspired by a true event</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological and atmospheric horror-focused design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality sound design with disturbing effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumpscares and an immersive exploration-oriented experience</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTENT WARNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains jump scares, disturbing environments, and psychological horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not recommended for individuals with heart conditions, epilepsy, or during pregnancy.</strong><br>Please play with caution.</p>","developers":["Dead Witness"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902550/5a3b657810ae6e2de691b3adff1020b84b115fde/header.jpg?t=1763207073","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3902550/478999116/3f73fa070bb1fdbfd0c30b0f3b9d8855c9b869d3/1760184482/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760375401","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3902550/478999116/3f73fa070bb1fdbfd0c30b0f3b9d8855c9b869d3/1760184482/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760375401","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3902550/478999116/3f73fa070bb1fdbfd0c30b0f3b9d8855c9b869d3/1760184482/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760375401","id":257216035,"name":"Antichrist Main Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216035/dea7f3b4032f5a3ae07930ccdf41db35f7ab61eb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760375401"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3902550/749744144/b765f515fbb855d17aa5232601e40fdad863b891/1760186502/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760375405","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3902550/749744144/b765f515fbb855d17aa5232601e40fdad863b891/1760186502/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760375405","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers